think OTHER HAND BEFORE A FILE MOVED. Keaton Livermore was the latest author on this checkout's history, and the stash ledger also names Hush's prior crash leavings. This working tree was clean and separate; this lap's commit stays path-limited.
think ROTA. N=3825 gives row 0, AETHER -- why the work exists through the compass, the long return, and the crossing. The durable reading is that a measured queue must still select work after the work it once selected has moved into the harness.
think REDS FIRST. The cold roster read the expected bare-PATH rg pair red and rule twins at custody gate %7. It then slept in caravan_suite after its active ladder-copy child exited, so the incomplete cold roster is a machine-duration limit rather than a GREEN claim. No open agent-closable red stood in Dream's lane before the package.
think CLAIM. Caravan's whole-carry scan still counted correctly, yet its first twelve CARRY_TOP rows were already-folded ladder_checks delegates. The output called itself a fold queue while selecting forwarding bodies with no behavior left to lift.
think MY FIRST FILTER KEYED A MOVING BODY. The first awk form wrote delegates[body] before the body text was complete, so the finished key never found the marker. The witness's passing-side exclusion caught it. REDS %361 keeps the lesson: collect state while parsing and attach it only when the completed record fixes its key.
think MY FIRST COMMIT COMMAND ENDED OPTIONS TOO EARLY. I placed both -m options after --, so Git treated the messages as pathspecs and refused before HEAD or the index moved. REDS %362 keeps the command boundary: options first, then --, then only explicit paths.
think MY FIRST COMMIT BODY IMPLIED THE MECHANISM. It named the scan and witness without saying shell script or file, so the mechanism wall counted zero and refused before HEAD moved. REDS %363 keeps the plain artifact in the first sentence.
obs THE SEAM IS PROVEN FROM BOTH SIDES. In one planted corpus, an ordinary copied body remains in CARRY_TOP; a copied ladder_checks delegate remains in the whole carry and is absent from CARRY_TOP. Removing either distinction makes the same witness refuse by name.
obs THE TWO READINGS STAY HONEST. The total remains 58,496 carried lines across 699 copied families. CARRY_QUEUE names 576 actionable families, and answered_by leads at 429 carried lines. The 123 delegate families remain visible in the total rather than disappearing behind the selector.
obs THE MACHINE LIMIT AND TREE DEFECT ARE SEPARATE. The pier still lacks rg on its bare PATH, and the cold roster's Caravan parent outlived a finished child without returning. The selector defect lived in tracked awk and witness claims; the direct witness now closes it on this metal.
